skepticism, and the American way of war.

00:00:26.942 --> 00:00:28.892
I'm Henri thank you for joining us.

00:00:28.892 --> 00:00:32.792
Today with me is, uh, a very
special guest, somebody we wanted

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:33.962
to talk to for, for quite a.

00:00:34.892 --> 00:00:38.102
Um, the, the, the myth
man, the legend, Mr.

00:00:38.102 --> 00:00:38.882
