00:00:39.812 --> 00:00:43.562
Um, and, uh, we're gonna get to chat
with him for a while and try, you

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:47.402
know, uh, hear about some of, uh,
his experiences, many experiences.

00:00:47.972 --> 00:00:53.192
Um, for anybody who doesn't know,
uh, John Kiriakou was a, a former

00:00:53.192 --> 00:00:57.752
CIA counterterrorism officer and a
former senior investigator with the

00:00:57.752 --> 00:00:59.192
