00:12:49.355 --> 00:12:54.815
You know, one of the things that struck me
post nine 11 on Iraq, I, I was intimately

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.645
involved in the planning for the Iraq war.

00:12:56.645 --> 00:13:00.935
I go into great detail about this
in my first book and, um, one of the

00:13:00.935 --> 00:13:05.705
things that really struck me was how
these very important people at the

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:11.165
White House, uh, and in the, the power
structure at the Pentagon knew literally.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:16.620
About Iraqi history, about
Iraqi culture and society.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:22.080
I remember participating in a secure
video teleconference where one of

00:13:22.085 --> 00:13:25.710
the deputy directors of the National
Security Council said, and this was the

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:28.260
