00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:30.690
He said, when we crossed
that border tomorrow, they're

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:32.280
gonna throw flowers at us.

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:37.260
And I turned to my boss and I
said, was that a joke or did

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:38.880
they really know nothing about.

00:13:40.275 --> 00:13:43.125
And the answer, I'm sorry to
say was that they knew nothing.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:55.800
Henri: Thing to look back at and
especially like, you know, to, you

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:59.580
know, I, I, I, I realized looking
