00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:56.980
John Kirakou: Yeah, so communications
management units are specialized units

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:59.410
inside the US Federal Prison system.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.300
There are two of them, one.

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:05.020
is in the federal penitentiary
at Terre Haute, Indiana.

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:07.030
It used to be Federal Death Row.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:12.430
They built a new death row and then
made the old death row into A C M U.

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:16.180
The other communications
management unit is at the Supermax

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.940
Prison in Marion, Illinois.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:23.800
Now, the whole purpose of creating
a a a communications management.

00:15:24.595 --> 00:15:25.465
Those are important.

00:15:25.465 --> 00:15:26.545
Three important words.

00:15:27.055 --> 00:15:32.455
That is a, a unit inside the most
secure prisons in America where

00:15:32.455 --> 00:15:36.865
all communication with the outside
world can be controlled, right?

00:15:37.015 --> 00:15:41.425
So you have Omar Ab, the
Blind Shake, who's now dead.

00:15:41.905 --> 00:15:45.545
You don't want him communicating
with people on the outside.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:49.180
So he can plan additional
terrorist attacks, right?

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:51.280
